## 2. Page & Bug Fixes

* **Scroll Trigger Lookup Fix**: Fixed a bug in [`ScrollMotionInstance`](file:///d:/dev/motionpath/src/domain/MotionInstance.js#L292-L308) where the trigger element resolver checked only `trigger.startTrigger` from the schema. It now correctly checks `trigger.trigger` (which conforms to the schema specification) first before falling back to `startTrigger`. This fixes the `"trigger ref 'lantern-scene' is not registered"` crash in Pasar Malam pages.
* **MotorcyclePage.jsx**: Mounted all scene timeline players explicitly and updated sub-components to subscribe to the stateful instance.
* **PasarMalamPage.jsx** / **PasarMalamObserverPage.jsx**: Mounted the story, entry-lantern, and bounce-lantern scenes, and fed them down to all sub-components.

